# Read by git as $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/git/ignore with no core.excludesFile needed,
# and by fd and ripgrep through the same lookup -- one file, three tools.
#
# `vendor/` is here by choice. Go and some PHP projects do commit it, and this
# file keeps it out of `git status` and `git add` in every repository. Any repo
# that needs it tracked overrides this with `!vendor/` in its own .gitignore.

